SUMMARY:Creating Toronto: The Story of a City
DESCRIPTION:An exciting tour led by Heritage Toronto \nExplore some of the city’s most famous spots in the historic St. Lawrence neighborhood. \nDiscover fascinating stories and hidden gems that bring Toronto’s rich history to life. \nMeeting Point: 149 King Street East \nWho is for: Newcomers to Canada(Permanent residents and Convention refugees) \nTo register: Please fill this form \nFor more information: Please contact Karen at kau-yeung@culturelink.ca or 416-986-4219 \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/creating-toronto-the-story-of-a-city/
LOCATION:St. Lawrence neighbourhood
CATEGORIES:Families
