SUMMARY:Free Hockey Game – Toronto Marlies vs. Rochester Americans
DESCRIPTION:Come cheer on your favourite team\, enjoy an exciting game\, and make wonderful memories together!  \nWardiere Inc. Presentx \nFree Hockey Game for newcomer children and youth aged 6-30 and their families who are permanent residents or convention refugees/ protected person. \nDon’t miss this opportunity to experience the excitement of live hockey!  \nTo register: Please fill this form   \nFor more information: Please contact Anton Gordiienko at 437-245-1118 or email at agordiienko@culturelink.ca \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/free-hockey-game-toronto-marlies-vs-rochester-americans/
LOCATION:Coca-Cola Coliseum\, 45 Manitoba Drive\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6K 3C3\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Youth
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Youth-Wellness-Community-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
