SUMMARY:NEATwalks: Magical Art Walk with Festive Music
DESCRIPTION:Newcomers explore and appreciate Toronto! \nExplore urban art and watch it transform into augmented reality while enjoying the live music. \n\nRain or shine we will be there (outdoor event)\nDress for the weather\nArrive by 10:50 am\nBring water\, snacks\, and camera\nFamily friendly event\nExpect crowed\, noise\, and narrow walking paths\n\nMeeting Point:  TTC Stop #3502 – Indian Gr /Dundas St W \nWho is for: Permanent residents and Convention refugees (need to provide copy of immigration documents).  \nRegistration is required for the purpose of media and liability releases. \nTo register: For new participants please fill this form  \nFor returning participants\, reserve your spot via text (437-249-7103) or email ( rchauhan@culturelink.ca)
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/neatwalks-magical-art-walk-with-festive-music/
LOCATION:Indian Grove & Dundas St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Neat-Walks-Web-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
