SUMMARY:Cybersecurity Training Program
DESCRIPTION:Our Cybersecurity Training Program enables you to work towards your Cybersecurity Fundamentals Certificate\, and prepares you for your job search. \nThe program runs for 9 weeks: \n\nWeek 1: Canadian career development training\, online or in-person Monday to Friday\, 10am to 4pm\nWeeks 2-9: Evening sessions include instructor-led workshops\, online labs\, peer study and mock exam\, all online\n\nTo be considered\, please email cybersecurity@culturelink.ca expressing your interest in registering for the program. \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/cybersecurity-training-program-2026-11-30/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Cybersecurity-Training-Program-Web-Banner.png
END:VEVENT
