SUMMARY:The Future of Work and Emerging Technologies
DESCRIPTION:Join the conversation on how new technologies are shaping employment and in-demand skills. \nFirst\, our panelists will discuss AI/health\, enterprise product\, go-to-market\, and enterprise security: \n\nJudy Mellett\, Chief Marketing & Operating Officer at ProMed AI Inc.\nFahad Hafeez\, Senior Staff Product Manager at 1Password\nRob Manne\, Founder of Inflective\nMiguel Young\, Staff Enterprise Security Engineer at ClickUp\n\nThen\, we will break into table discussions where you can share your experiences\, ask questions\, and connect directly with panelists\, mentors\, and other newcomers. \nWe will also offer: \n\nEmployment counselling\nPersonalized resume feedback\nProfessional headshot\n\nEvent Schedule \n\n1:00 PM – 1:45 PM: Registration & welcome\, light lunch\, and networking\n1:45 PM – 2:45 PM: Employer Panel Discussion\n2:45 PM – 3:00 PM: Break\n3:00 PM – 4:30 PM: Networking and Career Support\n\nFill out the registration form to participate:  The Future of Work and Emerging Technologies: : Networking Event for Newcomers \nSpots are limited\, and preference will be given to Permanent Residents and Convention Refugees. \nDo you want to suggest questions for the panel? Visit our social media pages on Instagram or LinkedIn.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/the-future-of-work-and-emerging-technologies/
LOCATION:CultureLink\, 2340 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Icon-Web-New-Technologies-Event.png
END:VEVENT
